WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:16.510
&gt;&gt;FLORIDA GOVERNOR RICK SCOTT

00:00:12.506 --> 00:00:20.047
IS AMONG A GROWING CHORUS OF

00:00:16.644 --> 00:00:21.382
THOSE CALLING FOR FBI DIRECTOR

00:00:20.181 --> 00:00:24.285
CHRISTOPHER WRAY TO RESIGN.

00:00:21.515 --> 00:00:27.088
WE LEARNED TODAY THAT A CALLER

00:00:24.418 --> 00:00:30.091
TIPPED THE BUREAU OFF JUST LAST

00:00:27.221 --> 00:00:31.259
MONTH ABOUT THE FLORIDA SHOOTING

00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:33.094
SUSPECT NIKOLAS CRUZ.

00:00:31.392 --> 00:00:34.328
THEY WERE TOLD HE WANTED TO KILL

00:00:33.227 --> 00:00:35.263
PEOPLE AND WAS A POTENTIAL

00:00:34.462 --> 00:00:38.633
SCHOOL SHOOTER.

00:00:35.396 --> 00:00:40.134
HOW COULD THE FBI BOTCH THIS SO

00:00:38.766 --> 00:00:44.372
BADLY?

00:00:40.268 --> 00:00:49.644
JOINING US NOW IS STEVE ROGERS,

00:00:44.506 --> 00:00:50.879
A FORMER MEMBER OF THE FBI JOINT

00:00:49.778 --> 00:00:52.447
TERRORIST TASK FORCE.

00:00:51.012 --> 00:00:53.848
THIS IS JUST A HEARTBREAKER IN

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.950
SO MANY WAYS.

00:00:53.982 --> 00:01:01.323
I TRY TO PUT MYSELF IN THE

00:00:56.084 --> 00:01:06.161
POSITION OF A PARENT OR SPOUSE.

00:01:01.456 --> 00:01:08.930
THE FBI GETS THIS YOUTUBE TIP IN

00:01:06.294 --> 00:01:11.233
SEPTEMBER AND FOR SOME REASON

00:01:09.064 --> 00:01:12.100
COULDN’T FIGURE OUT WHO POSTED

00:01:11.366 --> 00:01:14.870
THAT COMMENT.

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:16.305
AND THEN IN JANUARY, A TIPSTER

00:01:15.003 --> 00:01:18.273
CALLS IN AND IT’S VERY SPECIFIC.

00:01:16.438 --> 00:01:19.808
A PERSON CLOSE TO CRUZ, HE HAS A

00:01:18.407 --> 00:01:21.310
GUN, ET CETERA, ET CETERA, HE

00:01:19.942 --> 00:01:22.711
COULD SHOOT THE SCHOOL.

00:01:21.443 --> 00:01:23.178
AND THEN NOTHING.

00:01:22.844 --> 00:01:29.251
WHAT HAPPENED?

00:01:23.312 --> 00:01:31.186
&gt;&gt;  LAURA, THIS WAS AN EPIC

00:01:29.384 --> 00:01:31.620
FAILURE AT LEADERSHIP

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:34.890
HEADQUARTERS.

00:01:31.754 --> 00:01:35.224
AN EPIC FAILURE OF INFORMATION

00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:36.492
SHARING.

00:01:35.357 --> 00:01:40.229
PRESIDENT TRUMP IN THE EARLY

00:01:36.625 --> 00:01:43.833
DAYS OF HIS CAMPAIGN WONDERS

00:01:40.362 --> 00:01:46.435
ABOUT PROBLEMS IN OUR

00:01:46.569 --> 00:01:48.504
INTELLIGENCE AGENCIES.

00:01:47.770 --> 00:01:51.440
THE PRESIDENT WAS RIGHT.

00:01:48.637 --> 00:01:53.509
I’VE GOT TO TELL YOU, THE

00:01:51.574 --> 00:01:55.511
MAGNITUDE, THE MOST PROFOUND TIP

00:01:53.642 --> 00:01:56.412
THEY GOT WAS WHAT WAS ON THAT

00:01:55.645 --> 00:01:57.146
YOUTUBE ABOUT BEING A

00:01:56.545 --> 00:01:58.447
PROFESSIONAL SHOOTER.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.649
YOU CONNECT THE DOTS.

00:01:58.581 --> 00:02:00.416
YOU DON’T STOP THE

00:01:59.782 --> 00:02:02.752
INVESTIGATION.

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:04.387
WHEN I HEARD THE FBI AGENT TALK

00:02:02.885 --> 00:02:09.492
ABOUT, WELL, WE LOOKED AT THE

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:09.826
YOUTUBE AND COULDN’T FIND THE IP

00:02:09.625 --> 00:02:11.361
ADDRESS.

00:02:09.959 --> 00:02:13.229
I WAS STUNNED.

00:02:11.494 --> 00:02:14.063
YOU KNOW WHAT YOU DO?

00:02:13.363 --> 00:02:18.635
IT WOULD BE SIMPLE.

00:02:14.197 --> 00:02:19.903
WHY NOT JUST PUT THE GUY’S NAME

00:02:18.768 --> 00:02:20.270
IN THE INSTAGRAM OR FACEBOOK

00:02:20.036 --> 00:02:22.372
PLATFORM?

00:02:20.403 --> 00:02:22.739
IT WAS HIS NAME. AND LOOKED WHAT

00:02:22.505 --> 00:02:24.307
CAME UP.

00:02:22.872 --> 00:02:26.576
THEY WOULD HAVE HAD THE NAME AND

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:29.479
GOTTEN THE LOCAL POLICE.

00:02:26.709 --> 00:02:31.614
THE QUESTION I HAD AND I BELIEVE

00:02:29.612 --> 00:02:35.151
STILL HAS TO BE LOOKED INTO, DID

00:02:31.748 --> 00:02:37.354
THE LOCAL POLICE GIVE THE FBI

00:02:35.285 --> 00:02:40.657
ANY INFORMATION AT ALL REGARDING

00:02:37.487 --> 00:02:43.393
THE DOMESTIC VIOLENCE CALLS?

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:44.394
BUT WHEN THAT NAME CAME UP, I’M

00:02:43.527 --> 00:02:46.329
WONDERING ALL THE INFORMATION

00:02:44.528 --> 00:02:51.935
THE POLICE HAD ABOUT THIS GUY,

00:02:46.463 --> 00:02:54.171
AND ON THE DOMESTIC VIOLENCE

00:02:52.069 --> 00:02:57.708
CALLS, WE ASKED THE QUESTION,

00:02:54.304 --> 00:02:58.475
ARE THERE ANY WEAPONS IN THE

00:02:57.841 --> 00:03:01.678
HOUSE?

00:02:58.609 --> 00:03:03.614
USUALLY EVERY POLICE DEPARTMENT

00:03:01.812 --> 00:03:05.816
HAS A DATABASE OF EVERY HOME

00:03:03.747 --> 00:03:06.517
THAT HAS A WEAPON TO PROTECT

00:03:05.949 --> 00:03:07.217
OFFICERS.

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.752
THERE WAS LITTLE OR NO

00:03:07.351 --> 00:03:11.922
INFORMATION SHARING AND THAT’S

00:03:08.886 --> 00:03:14.558
WHAT HAS TO BE INVESTIGATED.

00:03:12.056 --> 00:03:16.360
&gt;&gt;  THEY HAD BEEN TO HIS HOUSE

00:03:14.692 --> 00:03:16.694
39 TIMES FOR A VARIETY OF

00:03:16.493 --> 00:03:19.530
THINGS.

00:03:16.827 --> 00:03:22.733
HIS MOTHER WAS AFRAID OF HIM.

00:03:19.663 --> 00:03:24.168
HE WAS CUTTING HIMSELF ON

00:03:22.867 --> 00:03:27.004
INSTAGRAM AFTER HIS GIRLFRIEND

00:03:24.301 --> 00:03:28.973
BROKE UP WITH HIM.

00:03:27.138 --> 00:03:30.374
HE WAS A DECENT EMPLOYEE AT THE

00:03:29.106 --> 00:03:33.477
DOLLAR GENERAL STORE, BUT OTHER

00:03:30.508 --> 00:03:33.744
THAN THAT HE WAS A TOTAL NUT

00:03:33.611 --> 00:03:36.881
JOB.

00:03:33.878 --> 00:03:39.317
IT WAS RED FLAG AFTER RED FLAG.

00:03:37.014 --> 00:03:40.818
BUT IT’S ALMOST PEOPLE ARE

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:43.421
WORRIED ABOUT OFFENDING SOMEONE

00:03:40.952 --> 00:03:46.290
AND BRIDGING SOMEONE’S PRIVACY.

00:03:43.554 --> 00:03:53.064
I DON’T KNOW IF THEY’RE JUST

00:03:46.424 --> 00:03:55.433
OVERLOADED OR BUREAUCRACY.

00:03:53.197 --> 00:03:58.002
I THINK IT WAS A COLOSSAL

00:03:55.566 --> 00:03:59.938
MISTAKE ON THE LOCAL, STATE, AND

00:03:58.136 --> 00:04:01.172
FEDERAL LEVEL.

00:04:00.071 --> 00:04:02.373
BUT THE FEDERAL LEVEL TAKES THE

00:04:01.306 --> 00:04:04.409
CAKE FOR ME.

00:04:02.507 --> 00:04:05.777
&gt;&gt;  THERE’S NO EXCUSE FOR WHAT

00:04:04.542 --> 00:04:07.612
HAPPENED THERE.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:10.515
LOOK, COPS GET INSTINCT.

00:04:07.746 --> 00:04:11.816
AND I’VE ASKED ALL WEEK, ANY FBI

00:04:10.648 --> 00:04:13.918
AGENT WHO KNOWS ANYTHING ABOUT

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:16.054
HOW THIS HAPPENED AND WHERE THE

00:04:14.052 --> 00:04:17.656
FAILURES WERE, LAURA, THEY NEED

00:04:16.187 --> 00:04:20.158
TO COME FORWARD.

00:04:17.789 --> 00:04:20.492
COPS PUT UP THIS BLUE WALL OF

00:04:20.292 --> 00:04:22.794
SILENCE.

00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:24.029
AND IT HAPPENS ON A LOCAL AND

00:04:22.928 --> 00:04:25.897
FEDERAL LEVEL.

00:04:24.162 --> 00:04:26.832
TEAR DOWN THAT BLUE WALL OF

00:04:26.031 --> 00:04:27.165
SILENCE FOR THE GOOD OF THIS

00:04:26.965 --> 00:04:29.334
COUNTRY.

00:04:27.299 --> 00:04:30.535
A LOT OF COPS KNOW A LOT OF

00:04:29.468 --> 00:04:32.237
THINGS AND THEY WEREN’T COME

00:04:30.669 --> 00:04:32.571
FORWARD FOR ONE REASON OR

00:04:32.371 --> 00:04:33.572
ANOTHER.

00:04:32.704 --> 00:04:35.307
BUT IN THIS CASE THEY’VE GOT TO

00:04:33.705 --> 00:04:37.709
COME FORWARD.

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:41.380
&gt;&gt;  AND IT’S ALSO AMAZING IN

00:04:37.843 --> 00:04:43.415
THAT YOUTUBE VISIT THAT THE FBI

00:04:41.513 --> 00:04:44.817
FIELD OFFICE IN MISSISSIPPI MADE

00:04:43.549 --> 00:04:45.718
TO THE MAN WHO RAISED AN ALARM

00:04:44.950 --> 00:04:48.687
ABOUT IT.

00:04:45.851 --> 00:04:51.256
THEY VISITED HIM TWICE.

00:04:48.821 --> 00:04:52.791
THEY HAD THE NAME NIKOLAS CRUZ

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:55.361
FROM THE POSTING.

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:58.597
WHY WASN’T THAT PART OF THE FBI

00:04:55.494 --> 00:05:01.434
FILE SYSTEM SO WHEN THE CALL

00:04:58.731 --> 00:05:05.838
CAME IN, IT SEEMED LIKE THERE

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:06.205
SHOULD BE A CROSS-REFERENCING

00:05:05.971 --> 00:05:07.740
PROGRAM.

00:05:06.338 --> 00:05:08.074
MAYBE IT’S SILLY WHAT I’M

00:05:07.873 --> 00:05:09.375
SAYING.

00:05:08.207 --> 00:05:11.610
&gt;&gt;  IT’S NOT SILLY.

00:05:09.508 --> 00:05:13.612
DID LOCAL POLICE, DID THE SCHOOL

00:05:11.744 --> 00:05:14.480
SYSTEM SHARE INFORMATION?

00:05:13.746 --> 00:05:16.749
AND WHEN THIS PARTICULAR NAME

00:05:14.613 --> 00:05:18.284
CAME UP -- I’M SURE THE LOCAL

00:05:16.882 --> 00:05:19.318
POLICE SAW THAT YOUTUBE.

00:05:18.417 --> 00:05:19.852
EVERYBODY SEEMED TO HAVE KNOWN

00:05:19.452 --> 00:05:23.055
ABOUT IT.

00:05:19.986 --> 00:05:25.558
WHEN THAT NAME CAME UP, DID

00:05:23.189 --> 00:05:27.760
ANYBODY THINK, MAYBE WE SHOULD

00:05:25.691 --> 00:05:30.263
CHECK WITH FEDERAL AUTHORITIES

00:05:27.894 --> 00:05:31.898
OR MAYBE FEDERAL AUTHORITIES

00:05:30.396 --> 00:05:34.400
SHOULD CHECK WITH THE LOCALS IF

00:05:32.031 --> 00:05:36.870
THEY FOUND OUT WHERE THIS WAS.

00:05:34.534 --> 00:05:37.203
&gt;&gt;  SHOULD THE FBI DIRECTOR

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.572
RESIGN?

00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:44.410
&gt;&gt;  I SAID IT EARLIER AND I’LL

00:05:39.706 --> 00:05:46.579
SAY IT AGAIN THAT THE ENTIRE

00:05:44.544 --> 00:05:47.781
LEADERSHIP SHOULD RESIGN OR BE

00:05:46.713 --> 00:05:50.116
FIRED.

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:51.117
I’M GLAD HE NOW HAS ATTORNEY

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:53.553
GENERAL SESSIONS LOOKING INTO IT

00:05:51.251 --> 00:05:55.455
AND INVESTIGATING IT.

